    "name": "Space Combat Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 2820730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820730/extras/ec1a244e12c583b36de4135d32a04481.avif?t=1751662375\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span>Space Combat Simulator is a spacecraft action simulator. Choose one of dozens of ships to complete many dangerous missions across the solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in epic battles, conquer bases and destroy large battleships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a choice of ships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the ability to control large battlecruisers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a variety of missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New locations, planet surfaces, urban combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- local co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- base combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse locations:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mars, Venus, Earth, Mercury, Pluto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combined orbital missions, possibly looking at the surface of a planet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Known moons Io, Europa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visit exoplanets</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820730/extras/ec1a244e12c583b36de4135d32a04481.avif?t=1751662375\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span>Space Combat Simulator is a spacecraft action simulator. Choose one of dozens of ships to complete many dangerous missions across the solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in epic battles, conquer bases and destroy large battleships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a choice of ships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the ability to control large battlecruisers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a variety of missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New locations, planet surfaces, urban combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- local co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- base combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse locations:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mars, Venus, Earth, Mercury, Pluto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combined orbital missions, possibly looking at the surface of a planet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Known moons Io, Europa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visit exoplanets</p>",
